---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "Plantcore AI - Sinthome";
---

<PageLayout title={pageTitle} useContentLayout={true}>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Plantcore AI</h1>
      <p class="text-2xl text-gray-600 font-light">Building the first Industrial Vertical Large Language Model</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-red-600 pl-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Mission — Reshaping the Future of Industry</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-xl mb-6">
          We are building the world's first Industrial Vertical Large Language Model to fundamentally transform
          how manufacturing organizations make decisions, accumulate knowledge, and drive continuous improvement.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg">
          By creating an AI-driven decision intelligence layer that sits above traditional ERP systems, we enable
          factories to capture, standardize, and amplify the collective wisdom embedded in millions of daily
          operational decisions—unlocking unprecedented efficiency, agility, and competitive advantage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Method Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-red-600 pl-8 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Method — Starting from Decisions</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
          AI Agents generate direct value and capture decision points where ERP systems cannot reach.
          These agents deliver immediate ROI while creating a sustainable stream of decision assets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Three-Layer Architecture Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Layer 1: AI Agents -->
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-8 hover:border-red-600 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold">
                1
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">AI Agents</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Deployed across factories to assist with critical decision-making in procurement, inventory management,
                production planning, and quality control. These agents provide immediate operational value while
                continuously learning from human expertise.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4 border-red-600">
                <p class="text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-2">Direct Business Impact:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-1">
                  <li>• 10%+ procurement cost reduction</li>
                  <li>• 7% inventory shrinkage reduction</li>
                  <li>• Real-time decision support at scale</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Layer 2: CDO Data Platform -->
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-8 hover:border-red-600 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold">
                2
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">CDO Data Platform</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Captures and standardizes Contextualized Decision Outcomes—transforming raw operational choices
                into structured, machine-readable knowledge assets. This platform creates a unified language for
                industrial intelligence across diverse manufacturing contexts.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4 border-red-600">
                <p class="text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-2">Key Capabilities:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-1">
                  <li>• Decision context capture and normalization</li>
                  <li>• Cross-factory knowledge transfer</li>
                  <li>• Real-time learning from outcomes</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Layer 3: Industrial Vertical LLM -->
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-8 hover:border-red-600 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold">
                3
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Industrial Vertical LLM</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Trained on millions of validated decision samples to become the "operating system" of Industry 4.0.
                This foundation model understands manufacturing context at unprecedented depth, providing intelligent
                guidance that adapts to each factory's unique environment and challenges.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 border-l-4 border-red-600">
                <p class="text-gray-800 font-semibold mb-2">Transformative Potential:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-1">
                  <li>• Predictive decision intelligence</li>
                  <li>• Automated best-practice discovery</li>
                  <li>• Continuous optimization at scale</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Architecture Summary -->
      <div class="mt-12 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 border-2 border-gray-200">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-center">
          This three-layer architecture creates a systematic foundation for industrial knowledge accumulation,
          transfer, and amplification across global manufacturing networks—transforming how factories learn,
          adapt, and compete in the digital age.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Vision Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Vision: 2030 Roadmap</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Building the industrial intelligence network of the future</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Roadmap Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-10 text-center hover:border-blue-600 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="text-6xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4">10,000</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Factories Connected</div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            Global manufacturing network with comprehensive decision intelligence coverage across industries and geographies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-green-200 rounded-lg p-10 text-center hover:border-green-600 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="text-6xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-4">150K+</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">AI Agents Deployed</div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            Comprehensive decision capture points covering all critical industrial processes and operational scenarios.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Vision Statement -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-12 border-2 border-gray-200">
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Our vision is to build, within the next five years, a decision-data-driven industrial intelligence
            network through continuous agent deployment and CDO data collection.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            By 2030, Plantcore AI will reach 10,000 factories and 150,000 AI Agents, generating hundreds of
            millions of validated decision samples. This massive scale will create the world's most comprehensive
            understanding of industrial operations and decision-making patterns.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            On this foundation, we will train and deploy the world's first Industrial Vertical LLM—an engine
            of decision-making grounded in authentic factory data. This LLM will serve as the operating system
            of Industry 4.0, guiding real-time production choices, amplifying collective industrial knowledge,
            and reshaping how humans and machines collaborate in production environments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border-l-4 border-red-600 rounded-r-lg p-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">Core Belief</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 text-center">
            The True Industrial Revolution
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            At Plantcore AI, we believe the true industrial revolution is not the replacement of workers by machines,
            but the creation of an intelligent decision network—powered by an Industrial LLM—that redefines the
            relationship between humans and production, opening new possibilities for the industries and societies
            of the future.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We are building technology that amplifies human expertise rather than replaces it, creating a symbiotic
            relationship where AI systems learn from human judgment while providing unprecedented decision support
            and insights. This is the foundation for a more productive, sustainable, and human-centric industrial future.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Get in Touch</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12">
        Interested in learning more about Plantcore AI or exploring partnership opportunities?
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact"
           class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-red-600 text-white text-lg font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-red-700 transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
          Request a Demo
        </a>
        <a href="/contact"
           class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white text-red-600 text-lg font-semibold rounded-lg border-2 border-red-600 hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors duration-300">
          Join Pilot Program
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
